items.summary:
🇩🇪🇺🇦 Ukraine and Germany signed 15 more agreements, - Zelensky
▪new Siemens Energy pumping equipment to support Naftogaz during the war;
▪large order for IRIS-T air defense systems from Diehl;
▪work on increasing the production of missiles for Patriot in Germany;
▪cooperation on Freyja in the field of air defense;
▪order of Hensoldt radars to detect enemy targets;
▪contract with FFG for the supply of ammunition for an estimated 2 billion euros;
▪agreements with Amprion, Steag and Energo to get through the winter period.

